User1 (admin) can add, update, or remove computer records in the lab.
User2 (student) can check which computers are currently available or in use.
User1 can log system faults or mark a computer as "under repair".
User2 can book or reserve a computer for a specific time slot.
User1 can view a report of daily lab usage and attendance.
User2 can log in and log out to track their lab session time.